416	//  HBM bf16 ACTS buffer (Fork B). Carved from the FRONT of the workspace the
417	//  host already allocates (float[nCTA*total + nCTA]); Fork B does not use that
418	//  space for the eliminated 223 MB grad partials, so it is free real estate.
419	//  Reinterpreted as __nv_bfloat16. Total 80,546,592 bf16 (161 MB) << the 223 MB
420	//  workspace; 62 MB headroom. All regions row-major [rows x width].
421	//
422	//  Offsets are RUNTIME (depend on T = B*kSeq, B is a host arg), computed by
